{
  "bodyHash": "cf56a5adba0786fd",
  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"781078843056368612220679\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FszWTIQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"420\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Relics 是一款易于安装、支持拖拽放置的模组，添加了数十种具有复杂且设计精良机制的独特物品。每件遗物的真正潜力既可以在单独使用时解锁，也可以与其他遗物甚至其他模组搭配时激发。在创建每个遗物时，我们考虑到整合包绝不会只包含我们这一个模组，因此模组的平衡性会自动适配整合包的需求，这使得 Relics 既能完美融入类原版整合包，也能适应那些生命值和伤害数值高达数千的硬核整合包。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5sPMQuK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"386\" /></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">我的世界并非无尽，游戏内容迟早会耗尽，玩家必须自己寻找乐趣。我们考虑到了这一点，并致力于让 Relics 的体验尽可能长久有趣。得益于我们的升级系统与随机属性，每一件遗物都不会千篇一律。玩家可以自由决定从遗物中获取什么能力，从而生成近乎无限数量的遗物套装组合。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/339/2023-04-21_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"232\" /></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">使用本模组，你将获得：</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 28 件拥有独特且复杂机制的遗物。集齐它们吧！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 类似 MMO 的随机属性系统。寻找最佳遗物，或亲手重铸它们！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 遗物的强化与自定义功能。打造属于你的无敌组合！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 进阶主动技能系统。展示你所有的微操技巧！</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"918249872476659861259619\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYHFXh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"116\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">SSKirillSS - 经理，开发者</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: sskirillss</span></li>\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Telegram: @SSKirillSS</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">julewernvvp - 美术</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: julewern</span></li>\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Sketchfab: <a href=\"https://sketchfab.com/julewernvvp\">LINK</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Vebste - 测试员</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: vebste.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"084308688994070370956414\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2x3ogo6.png\" width=\"181\" height=\"116\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 有移植到 Fabric/Quilt 的计划吗？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">A: 目前暂无移植计划。但如果 Relics 进入</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-quot\">“完成</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">阶段”且我依然有兴趣的话，未来仍有可能移植。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 有移植到其他 Minecraft 版本的计划吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">A: 每次移植到新 MC 版本都会伴随 Relics 的重大更新，因为这通常意味着模组底层发生了根本性变化。我会在新版本模组内容全部公开发布后，立即开始移植工作。至于旧版本——不会，没有向后移植。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 能添加指南书之类的东西吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">A: 我不太喜欢指南书的概念。所以没有，暂不计划。但你可以自行将其添加到你的整合包中，或者如果你愿意，可以创建一个公共维基。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 新 MC 版本中 Relics 的内容会移植到旧版本吗？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">A: 不会。新增内容仅会添加至 Relics 当前所在的新版 MC。所有其他版本均处于</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-ldquo\">“仅修复错误”</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">状态。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 我可以为 Relics 制作附属模组吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">A: 可以，但……我现在不建议这么做。仅仅是因为 Relics 的 API 尚不稳定且经常变更。最好的办法是等待情况稳定后再进行开发。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 我可以创建你模组的公开分支/历史版本吗？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">A: 不行。但如果是为了私人用途</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-lparen\">（我</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">指和朋友一起玩等，且不发布到 CF 或其他平台）——那是可以的。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 我可以在整合包中使用你的模组吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">A: 可以，随你便。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 我可以把你的模组转载到其他网站吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">A: 不行。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Q: 我可以参考你的代码来开发我的模组吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">A: 尽管模组的许可证是 ARR，但你仍然可以将 Relics 的代码作为参考。不过，请不要直接 Ctrl+C &rarr; Ctrl+V。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">还有问题？- <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\"><strong>访问我们的 Discord！</strong></a></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><hr /></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>注意：</strong>本模组说明仅适用于 1.19.2 及更高版本的 Minecraft！</span></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
